{
  "language": "zh",
  "duration": 549.5945,
  "segments": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 2.28,
      "text": "这是一个特别适合创业的时代"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "start": 3.28,
      "end": 4.48,
      "text": "尤其是普通人"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start": 4.48,
      "end": 7.48,
      "text": "我认为普通人就应该在这个时代创业"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start": 7.48,
      "end": 9.48,
      "text": "我这么说肯定会有很认反对"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start": 10.12,
      "end": 13.12,
      "text": "说确认创业的人不是傻就是坏"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start": 13.92,
      "end": 17.08,
      "text": "还有很认识创业的镜头就是复在"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start": 17.08,
      "end": 17.88,
      "text": "对吧"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start": 17.88,
      "end": 21.24,
      "text": "我不怕得罪凡是这么认为的人"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start": 21.24,
      "end": 22.96,
      "text": "你的认知都极低"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start": 23.24,
      "end": 26.12,
      "text": "而且在生活中没有什么创业"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start": 26.12,
      "end": 27.52,
      "text": "你不信你对照一下"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start": 27.52,
      "end": 28.4,
      "text": "对吧"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start": 28.4,
      "end": 29.8,
      "text": "我不怕得罪你"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start": 29.8,
      "end": 31.2,
      "text": "我为什么会这么说呢"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "start": 31.2,
      "end": 34.48,
      "text": "我们之所以认为普通人不是和创业"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "start": 34.48,
      "end": 35.44,
      "text": "首先低个原因"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "start": 35.44,
      "end": 38.64,
      "text": "就是普通人没有设错的成本"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "start": 39.28,
      "end": 41.28,
      "text": "哪钱都拿不出来"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "start": 41.28,
      "end": 42.44,
      "text": "这是事实"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "start": 42.44,
      "end": 44.88,
      "text": "去年的时候有一个朋友小意过"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "start": 44.88,
      "end": 45.88,
      "text": "在吃博裂说过了"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "start": 45.88,
      "end": 46.24,
      "text": "对吧"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "start": 46.24,
      "end": 49.48,
      "text": "然后做了一块AI的产品"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "start": 49.48,
      "end": 52.08,
      "text": "一上来就获得得很好的结果"
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "start": 52.08,
      "end": 53.88,
      "text": "我当然问他无论这个项目投了多少钱"
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "start": 53.88,
      "end": 54.88,
      "text": "脱头400万"
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "start": 54.88,
      "end": 56.44,
      "text": "有多少人能拿出4万"
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "start": 56.44,
      "end": 58.04,
      "text": "400万都拿不出来"
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "start": 58.04,
      "end": 58.48,
      "text": "对吧"
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "start": 58.48,
      "end": 61.48,
      "text": "就很多人没有试错的能力"
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "start": 61.48,
      "end": 63.08,
      "text": "这是原因之一"
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "start": 63.08,
      "end": 64.48,
      "text": "但是各位"
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "start": 64.48,
      "end": 65.68,
      "text": "我们这边有输过"
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "start": 65.68,
      "end": 66.68,
      "text": "你先别否认他"
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "start": 66.68,
      "end": 67.48,
      "text": "我后面会讲"
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "start": 67.48,
      "end": 68.96,
      "text": "如果是可以做到的"
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "start": 68.96,
      "end": 72.68,
      "text": "如果你创业不需要什么成本"
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "start": 72.68,
      "end": 75.0,
      "text": "我的成本级低的话"
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "start": 75.0,
      "end": 76.4,
      "text": "有会怎么样呢"
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "start": 76.4,
      "end": 77.8,
      "text": "以后我会解释"
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "start": 77.8,
      "end": 79.0,
      "text": "然后两家二个"
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "start": 79.0,
      "end": 82.24,
      "text": "很认说创业不动人不适合创业"
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "start": 82.24,
      "end": 82.56,
      "text": "对吧"
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "start": 82.56,
      "end": 83.88,
      "text": "要创业的镜头是复杉"
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "start": 83.88,
      "end": 84.68,
      "text": "为什么"
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "start": 84.72,
      "end": 87.16,
      "text": "因为很多手你投了大量的时间"
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "start": 87.16,
      "end": 88.72,
      "text": "而成本"
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "start": 88.72,
      "end": 90.56,
      "text": "然后资金而人卖"
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "start": 90.56,
      "end": 90.96,
      "text": "对吧"
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "start": 90.96,
      "end": 92.68,
      "text": "但是东西出来以后"
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "start": 92.68,
      "end": 93.88,
      "text": "上市了之后"
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "start": 93.88,
      "end": 95.76,
      "text": "没有人卖"
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "start": 95.76,
      "end": 96.84,
      "text": "就牵了一批股在"
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "start": 96.84,
      "end": 98.48,
      "text": "一面投入没有产出嘛"
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "start": 98.48,
      "end": 99.12,
      "text": "对不对"
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "start": 99.12,
      "end": 100.44,
      "text": "但是这里边我有说一个主话"
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "start": 100.44,
      "end": 102.12,
      "text": "如果你的这个产品"
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "start": 102.12,
      "end": 105.36,
      "text": "在没有做之前"
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "start": 105.36,
      "end": 108.76,
      "text": "已经有大量的腐费的用过了"
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "start": 108.76,
      "end": 110.92,
      "text": "那又会怎么样呢"
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "start": 110.92,
      "end": 112.12,
      "text": "反正说这两个如果"
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "start": 112.12,
      "end": 113.04,
      "text": "就做梦养"
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "start": 113.04,
      "end": 113.92,
      "text": "我告诉你"
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "start": 113.92,
      "end": 116.32,
      "text": "这是可以做到的"
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "start": 116.32,
      "end": 118.24,
      "text": "创业是有防法的"
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "start": 118.24,
      "end": 121.84,
      "text": "和学习学习也是有防法的"
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "start": 121.84,
      "end": 124.04,
      "text": "有防法和媒方法的人"
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "start": 124.04,
      "end": 126.0,
      "text": "这个差别特别大"
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "start": 126.0,
      "end": 127.96,
      "text": "那今天给大家介绍一个方法"
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "start": 127.96,
      "end": 130.48,
      "text": "叫A.C.T."
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "start": 130.48,
      "end": 132.04,
      "text": "我先简单说字面一次"
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "start": 132.04,
      "end": 134.24,
      "text": "然后给大家觉得实际的例子"
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "start": 134.24,
      "end": 136.28,
      "text": "什么是A就是用户"
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "start": 136.28,
      "end": 138.0,
      "text": "就是你在创业之前"
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "start": 138.0,
      "end": 140.4,
      "text": "先想就是你的用户是谁"
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "start": 140.4,
      "end": 142.36,
      "text": "别投钱一分钱都不投"
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "start": 142.8,
      "end": 144.08,
      "text": "创业之前先想"
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "start": 144.08,
      "end": 145.84,
      "text": "你的用户是谁"
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "start": 145.84,
      "end": 147.16,
      "text": "他有什么样的问题"
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "start": 147.16,
      "end": 148.24,
      "text": "大家什么场景下"
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "start": 148.24,
      "end": 149.48,
      "text": "遇到什么的问题"
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "start": 149.48,
      "end": 151.64,
      "text": "你可以怎么帮他解决"
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "start": 151.64,
      "end": 152.8,
      "text": "但一分钱都投"
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "start": 152.8,
      "end": 154.32,
      "text": "只想这个用户是谁"
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "start": 154.32,
      "end": 155.44,
      "text": "就是A"
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "start": 155.44,
      "end": 157.6,
      "text": "第二个部分的方法就得C"
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "start": 157.6,
      "end": 159.6,
      "text": "主要这里边有个重点"
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "start": 159.6,
      "end": 161.0,
      "text": "这个重点是什么呢"
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "start": 161.0,
      "end": 163.12,
      "text": "就是C的意思是钩通"
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "start": 163.12,
      "end": 165.24,
      "text": "先和用户钩通"
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "start": 165.24,
      "end": 166.04,
      "text": "什么意思呢"
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "start": 166.04,
      "end": 167.44,
      "text": "各位假设"
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "start": 167.44,
      "end": 169.12,
      "text": "你戴创业之前"
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "start": 169.12,
      "end": 170.2,
      "text": "什么你要投入很多时间"
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "start": 170.2,
      "end": 171.28,
      "text": "经历人力"
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "start": 171.28,
      "end": 172.4,
      "text": "最晚一个产品做出来吗"
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "start": 172.4,
      "end": 173.44,
      "text": "好现在各位"
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "start": 173.44,
      "end": 174.36,
      "text": "你的产品没做出来"
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "start": 174.36,
      "end": 176.84,
      "text": "但是你想你的产品做出来的"
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "start": 176.84,
      "end": 178.72,
      "text": "所以随便你的产品已经做出来的"
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "start": 178.72,
      "end": 179.84,
      "text": "现在产品已经有了"
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "start": 179.84,
      "end": 181.52,
      "text": "OK了"
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "start": 181.52,
      "end": 184.28,
      "text": "就查报市场推广了"
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "start": 184.28,
      "end": 185.72,
      "text": "你是不是在推广"
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "start": 185.72,
      "end": 186.64,
      "text": "对不对"
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "start": 186.64,
      "end": 187.52,
      "text": "各位"
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "start": 187.52,
      "end": 188.92,
      "text": "这个是个关键里"
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "start": 188.92,
      "end": 190.24,
      "text": "帮我过来"
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "start": 190.24,
      "end": 191.8,
      "text": "别把产品做完了"
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "start": 191.8,
      "end": 193.48,
      "text": "都投入了在推广"
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "start": 193.48,
      "end": 195.72,
      "text": "而是先推广"
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "start": 195.72,
      "end": 196.72,
      "text": "再做"
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "start": 196.72,
      "end": 198.32,
      "text": "或者是同时做"
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "start": 198.32,
      "end": 200.2,
      "text": "终于这里边有很重要的话"
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "start": 200.2,
      "end": 200.92,
      "text": "这都是什么呢"
    },
    {
      "index": 116,
      "start": 200.92,
      "end": 203.76,
      "text": "既然故事就是你的策略"
    },
    {
      "index": 117,
      "start": 203.76,
      "end": 206.08,
      "text": "你先把这个故事讲出来"
    },
    {
      "index": 118,
      "start": 206.08,
      "end": 208.24,
      "text": "产品还不一种做出来呢"
    },
    {
      "index": 119,
      "start": 208.24,
      "end": 208.84,
      "text": "但是呢"
    },
    {
      "index": 120,
      "start": 208.84,
      "end": 210.92,
      "text": "来获取用户的反馈"
    },
    {
      "index": 121,
      "start": 210.92,
      "end": 213.0,
      "text": "如果用户有反馈"
    },
    {
      "index": 122,
      "start": 213.0,
      "end": 213.52,
      "text": "太好了"
    },
    {
      "index": 123,
      "start": 213.52,
      "end": 215.68,
      "text": "如果用户没反馈"
    },
    {
      "index": 124,
      "start": 215.68,
      "end": 217.36,
      "text": "你还没做呢"
    },
    {
      "index": 125,
      "start": 217.36,
      "end": 218.76,
      "text": "各位能理由于是吗"
    },
    {
      "index": 126,
      "start": 218.76,
      "end": 220.36,
      "text": "就两个小例子"
    },
    {
      "index": 127,
      "start": 220.36,
      "end": 221.68,
      "text": "一个小例子叫招报"
    },
    {
      "index": 128,
      "start": 221.68,
      "end": 222.72,
      "text": "打去查"
    },
    {
      "index": 129,
      "start": 222.72,
      "end": 224.04,
      "text": "这个人在开始的时候"
    },
    {
      "index": 130,
      "start": 224.04,
      "end": 225.08,
      "text": "根本就没做"
    },
    {
      "index": 131,
      "start": 225.08,
      "end": 226.48,
      "text": "产品的产品干嘛的时候"
    },
    {
      "index": 132,
      "start": 226.48,
      "end": 227.88,
      "text": "就是运寸出吧"
    },
    {
      "index": 133,
      "start": 227.88,
      "end": 228.96,
      "text": "以前在处裁的时候"
    },
    {
      "index": 134,
      "start": 228.96,
      "end": 230.36,
      "text": "经常拿着纠款什么呢"
    },
    {
      "index": 135,
      "start": 230.36,
      "end": 231.32,
      "text": "他竟然会忘带"
    },
    {
      "index": 136,
      "start": 231.32,
      "end": 233.2,
      "text": "他又想要这个云寸出就好了"
    },
    {
      "index": 137,
      "start": 233.2,
      "end": 234.4,
      "text": "他有没有做这个产品呢"
    },
    {
      "index": 138,
      "start": 234.4,
      "end": 235.44,
      "text": "没做这个产品"
    },
    {
      "index": 139,
      "start": 235.44,
      "end": 236.8,
      "text": "他就直接拍了"
    },
    {
      "index": 140,
      "start": 236.8,
      "end": 238.16,
      "text": "拿紫贴了一个视频"
    },
    {
      "index": 141,
      "start": 238.16,
      "end": 239.68,
      "text": "假的故事放到网上了"
    },
    {
      "index": 142,
      "start": 239.68,
      "end": 241.76,
      "text": "几个好准夺问的"
    },
    {
      "index": 143,
      "start": 241.76,
      "end": 243.64,
      "text": "然后因为问的人多"
    },
    {
      "index": 144,
      "start": 243.64,
      "end": 245.28,
      "text": "最后他做了这么一款产品"
    },
    {
      "index": 145,
      "start": 245.28,
      "end": 247.12,
      "text": "和用户一块做这个产品"
    },
    {
      "index": 146,
      "start": 247.12,
      "end": 249.04,
      "text": "这个这个创业故事是有的"
    },
    {
      "index": 147,
      "start": 249.04,
      "end": 251.2,
      "text": "大家可以去去找一下"
    },
    {
      "index": 148,
      "start": 251.2,
      "end": 252.52,
      "text": "我在给大家几个小例子"
    },
    {
      "index": 149,
      "start": 252.52,
      "end": 254.0,
      "text": "就是我写的那个"
    },
    {
      "index": 150,
      "start": 254.0,
      "end": 255.4,
      "text": "假之心法那边说"
    },
    {
      "index": 151,
      "start": 255.4,
      "end": 256.6,
      "text": "不是先写完了"
    },
    {
      "index": 152,
      "start": 256.6,
      "end": 257.6,
